## What to deliver

Build the Gloamfin sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: an eyeless violet predator drawn in each
of its 32×32 frames — swimming down, up, left, and right (two frames each). When
you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are your finished
submission.
